OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of council workers face
OL,4,Awages cut in end to equal pay row
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of Glasgow City Council
OL,7,Fworkers are facing a loss in wages as
OL,8,Fthe local authority seeks to end a
OL,9,Flong-running equal pay dispute.
OL,11,FWhile a  majority of employees would be
OL,12,Fbetter off under a proposed settlement,
OL,13,Funions claims some individuals could
OL,14,Fsee their pay cut by as much as #10,000
OL,15,Fa year.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
