OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of council workers face
OL,4,Awages cut in end to equal pay row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local authority previously paid out
OL,7,Fabout #770m after it emerged female
OL,8,Fworkers in roles such as catering or
OL,9,Fcleaning had for years been receiving
OL,10,Fup to #3 an hour less than those in
OL,11,Fmale-dominated areas such as refuse
OL,12,Fcollection.
OL,14,FThe latest proposals would see new
OL,15,Fterms and conditions, external aimed at
OL,16,Fending unequal pay introduced on a
OL,17,Fphased basis from 4 April next year.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
